e_name": "Pythagoras_02.png", "id": "1521857538609718", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65402154_1521857545276384_6932935515601424484_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mb5tkYnLYPAQ7kNvwErEcCc&_nc_oc=AdpNULIXUKl57SsHT4lkonHnXsepLiniKgOzm4i70eG_F54S8gYwUc2YvJfSQzVZ7PE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUNBg0ADkSY9p-qiHPQ_4pnJu_UQp47F3IyCFPS3QHi6g&oe=6B0F225C"}, {"file_name": "Levy_02.png", "id": "196149426884252", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/43997710_196149430217585_1332548403471429223_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qZ3rbSf63-kQ7kNvwEKdeAN&_nc_oc=Adp-skem-U8i1cpnAbdOY1Y3SadnFG3syaiR2HBzCWRL7xzEnU98Y6bRBaWM1fif5kk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU3V4kT5a_UkgIvLBDbUW4WWA9QtC1E93aOpMnWaECaPg&oe=6B0F111B"}, {"file_name": "Radial_Solid.png", "id": "271501478838543", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031373_271501482171876_8031340628965781426_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uwEBcZDitEoQ7kNvwHcMHQl&_nc_oc=AdoMYdi_aKPXA8rNLy7NH002aeKzCkTcSt2ET9PUJF8ib-xXSZEt_LZuNhy3zlJdeXE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWu0JpRcPIMDrol1rzxnrLHnP9u2mkKfVs2mzcOkfXpkQ&oe=6B0F0B5B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Psydmind_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1020482742612505", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982514_1020482745945838_6452784102981224285_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BHKWd1HzIaQQ7kNvwGd7jAg&_nc_oc=AdpyRgThDUuOd_OjvfBV7l82Hg-ucNs2ivvrwQ_66zsrXf5yCP0cvm9U-xvkM36Uc2I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVeYmLlGNAa3aQLdvJ4k7tlgw-1t4dXIyM3pyzNLj2Dug&oe=6B0F22DB"}, "display_name": "VoctoR PsydMind", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the transformative power of VR meditation with PsydMind, your personal gateway to inner peace and well-being.\n\nPsydMind offers a powerful approach to meditation: \nFive distinct categories: Each scene is designed to address a specific mental health concern, incorporating elements of color theory, math, and shape theory to optimize your experience.\nGenerative art: Witness the mesmerizing beauty of evolving fractal landscapes, created through generative art, adding a dynamic and captivating element to your meditation practice.\nObject movement with binaural beats: Harmonize your brainwaves with the gentle movement of objects and the soothing sounds of binaural beats, promoting a deeper state of relaxation and focus.\n\nData collection and analysis: Gain insights into your progress and identify areas for improvement through anonymous data collection and analysis.\nBinaural beats: Incorporating beats with the moving objects could further promote relaxation and focus, aligning with the user's desired mental state.\nMusic: Carefully selected music can complement the visuals and binaural beats, creating a harmonious and immersive experience.\n\nAreas for further exploration:\nCustomizable parameters: Consider allowing users to adjust the parameters of the fractal drawings, binaural beats, and music to personalize their experience.\nIntegration with other tools: Investigate potential integration with other wellness apps or wearable devices to offer a more holistic approach to mental", "short_description": "Experience the transformative power of VR meditation with PsydMind, your personal gateway to inner peace and well-being.\nCombining the five categories of scenes (anxiety, stress, ADHD, insomnia, and depression) with design principles like fractal drawing using generative art sounds like a powerful and creative approach. Objects moving with binaural beats and music further enhances the immersive and therapeutic experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_p